ttp://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-07T17:48:03-07:00","id":1562856,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1561759-about-w6?p=1562852#post1562852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sure, we don't know yet if this &quot;love letter&quot; will include taking again in themselves to explore the serious real world problems WoD was made to explore. But if they do, W6 will have a lot to catch up. Also, since conservatives are all about climate change negation, the Swords of Hit... Heimdall will certainly decide the Nation was wrong all along and the right thing to do is Nordic Inspired coal mines.</div> </div> </div> </div>Personally I feel like Paradox might actually go in the oppiste extremes of W5 by turning W6 into something closer to LANCER, which is a combat heavy game that has deeper themes as backdrop but are totally regulated to narrative session with little to no manic support. That's my personal best case scenario.<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1561759-about-w6?p=1562854#post1562854\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Random Rant: The Swords of Heimdall (I refuse to call them the get) annoy me extra hard because the effort they had to go to in order to make Nazi werewolves. Clearly someone kept sending them back to not be Nazis but just generically evil reactionaries but all of the lines about being covered in hate tattoos and other bits were left in so they're still Nazis. Why would Garou be Nazis? They're from all over the world and an ancient species dating back to Stone Age times? Why would they switch to a relatively new philosophy? Why would they suddenly be the only tribe that fell? The Silver Fangs w....GAH!<br /> <br /> Sorry, we all want it gone but it's just....there.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean cursed thing parawolf could is make the cult playable... but still keep them as an antagonist as a minimum to gave W6 &quot;Depth and nuance&quot;./s<br /> <br /> Edit2: or even worse officially make the BSD playable and still keep the cult as pure antagonists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25848,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25848-mrornx","user":"MrornX","date":". 08-07-2026, 09:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25848-mrornx","name":"MrornX","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"418"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-08T06:46:14-07:00","id":1562873,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1561759-about-w6?p=1562853#post1562853\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;You thought that the first half the the Third Sign of the Phoenix was about radiation, but it was I, MICROPLASTICS!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Especially curious when we consider how much radiation seems to be less of a threat than we initially thought. Not harmless, but way less, and nature has experience navigating it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1561759-about-w6?p=1562854#post1562854\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Random Rant: The Swords of Heimdall (I refuse to call them the get) annoy me extra hard because the effort they had to go to in order to make Nazi werewolves. Clearly someone kept sending them back to not be Nazis but just generically evil reactionaries but all of the lines about being covered in hate tattoos and other bits were left in so they're still Nazis. Why would Garou be Nazis? They're from all over the world and an ancient species dating back to Stone Age times? Why would they switch to a relatively new philosophy? Why would they suddenly be the only tribe that fell? The Silver Fangs w....GAH!<br /> <br /> Sorry, we all want it gone but it's just....there.</div> </div> </div> </div>They are not the Get. They're never even called 'Get' in W5. Get over it, man. Fenris for them is just the fiercer aspect of their previous totem, Wolf. The tribe was never named and the Cult was a camp.<br /> <br /> And you'd be surprised about how many among the very groups the Nazis wanted dead are Nazi - like themselves. Nationalism, ethnic purity, all the problems that make a Nazi are common everywhere.<br /> <br /> Neo-Nazis too. Everywhere we have those groups that somehow create a version in their heads where they're a part of the Nazi ideal even if not white. Every country has at least some amount of Nazis among native population, including Israel. Bizarre, but it's there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}